    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d350">

                <pb facs="0507" n="249" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg249"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 300.115/5170b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2017. Agent Dippe Brothers, seed growers at Quedlinburg, telegraphs American
                    agent they have ready for shipment 50,000 bags beet seed subject export license.
                    Buyers must send certificate attested by State Department that goods for own use
                    and apply at British Embassy, Washington, confirmation transport security.</p>
                <p>Department Agriculture signifies willingness act as consignee for sugar-beet seed
                    imported for American sugar companies and that all seed will be reconsigned to
                    sugar companies only upon satisfactory guarantees from them that seed will be
                    used by them and will not be reexported.</p>
                <p>Understand Dippe Brothers influential with German Government, and suggest
                    Donegan, Magdeburg, interview and present these facts to them and request their
                    cooperation in getting necessary export licenses. British Embassy has been
                    requested to give special permit for shipment Rotterdam to New York, and you
                    will be advised of its action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
